**DR-10 LoopTrap (no confirmed arXiv ID):** **Anomaly found.** The Q-6 note (nlm.jsonl line 104) records the LoopTrap reference as `arXiv ae193ddf` — this is not a valid arXiv ID format. ArXiv IDs are `YYMM.NNNNN` (e.g., `2503.10362`). The string `ae193ddf` resembles a UUID fragment or git commit hash, not an arXiv identifier. The synthesis correctly flags the ID as unverified ("arXiv ID not captured in session" / "exact arXiv ID not confirmed"). The raw artifact confirms the 3.57× step amplification figure is sourced from whatever paper was found during DR-3, but the ID in the note is not a real arXiv identifier and cannot be used for external citation. Status: **ID refuted as invalid format; underlying paper exists but correct ID is not captured in any raw artifact**.

